  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6Dn7NvW.png\" alt=\"标题\"/></h1>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lava-turns-sand-into-glass-fabric-forge\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/883465?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lava-turns-sand-into-glass\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/lava-turns-sand-into-glass?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">這個可配置的模組讓沙塊在接觸岩漿時立即轉變為玻璃。非常適合用來建造玻璃農場，或只是為你的遊戲體驗增添一點趣味。&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DXY3iwp.png\" width=\"524\" /></p></center>\n<details>\n<summary><strong>配置</strong></summary>\n<p>你可以直接在遊戲中配置這個模組，或編輯你的設定檔資料夾中的JSON檔案 <code>config/lavasand.json</code>。</p>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>blocks_to_glass</b> - 岩漿會轉變為玻璃的方塊列表</p></center>\n</details>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"/>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"/></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"/></a>\n</p></center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
